pt;\">55<span style=\"font-family:新細明體, serif;\">吋智能電視，豪華三人沙發椅，</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">呎加大雙人置物掀床底及軟</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">Q</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">天然乳膠獨立筒床墊，</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">呎雙人大衣櫃，電動熱水瓶，室內及浴室都使用變頻換氣扇</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">室內不開窗也有好空氣，全自動洗衣機，獨立大陽台可曬被曬衣</span></span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:新細明體, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">附近有便利商店、廣興傳統市場、五權公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、南雅夜市、付費停車場。</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:新細明體, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">本房屋近亞東醫院捷運站、板橋火車站。</span></span>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "板橋區信義路150巷", "lat": "24.9911456", "lng": "121.4590187", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "四汴頭站", "distance": 48, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約48公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "信義公園站", "distance": 173, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約173公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "干城路口站", "distance": 183, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約183公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "迪斯尼開發股份有限公司", "distance": 870, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約870公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "Eggㄟ嗝嗝早午餐", "distance": 50, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約50公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市土城區廣福國民小學", "distance": 631, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約631公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市立重慶國民中學", "distance": 852, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約852公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "14,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key